                    "Did not find plate for {}, skipping mining hammer, spade, saw, axe, hoe, pickaxe, scythe, shovel, sword, hammer, file, knife, wrench recipes",
                    material.getName());
        }

        if (material.hasFlag(GENERATE_ROD)) {
